# head/adult/man/sharp: the elven Sharp head (man): angular planes stepping to a pointed chin
# P2b FACES (wave 2). Every head type keeps A3's eye rows and columns, the nose pixel and the mouth row
# (STYLE_P2 4), so expressions, marks and paint fit them all. Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body man
role head sharp
layer head
anchor head
keys rest

